            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alikuwako mtu mmoja hirimu aliyetoka Bethlehemu-yuda, wa jamaa ya Yuda, aliyekuwa ni Mlawi, naye akakaa huko hali ya ugeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtu huyo akatoka katika huo mji, katika Bethlehemu-yuda, ili aende kukaa hali ya ugeni hapo atakapoona mahali; akafikilia nchi ya vilima vilima ya Efraimu katika safari yake, hata nyumba ya huyo Mika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mika akamwuliza, Watoka wapi wewe? Akamwambia, Mimi ni Mlawi wa Bethlehemu-yuda, nami naenda kukaa hali ya ugeni po pote nitakapoona mahali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:10"
