                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mika akamwambia, kaa pamoja nami, uwe kwangu baba, tena kuhani, nami nitakupa fedha kumi mwaka kwa mwaka, na nguo ya kuvaa, na vyakula. Basi huyo Mlawi akaingia ndani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Huyo Mlawi aliridhika kukaa na mtu huyo; kisha huyo hirimu akawa kwake kama wanawe mmojawapo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi Mika akamweka wakfu huyo Mlawi, huyo hirimu, naye akawa kuhani wake, akakaa nyumbani mwa Mika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Mika akasema, Sasa najua ya kwamba BWANA atanitendea mema, kwa kuwa nina Mlawi kuwa kuhani wangu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.13"
            ]
          }
